# test: server_suspend_notification
# description: Installation suspension notifies attached sessions and the front door resumes them

## Environment

directory:
  name: project

terminal:
  name: T1
  cwd: project

terminal:
  name: T2

## Test

@T1
> amux new test-agent --name suspend-notify
> keepalive

@T2
> amux server suspend
Suspended 1 agent(s).

@T1
keepalive
echo: keepalive

[server suspending]

@T2
> amux server resume
Resumed 1 agent(s).
> amux list
Running agents:
  suspend-notify [test-agent] - $project.path
